<description>&lt;p&gt;Security personnel continue to be targeted in Syria, with attacks injuring four guards in Suwayda and a drone strike wounding four more, while a landmine blast in Idlib killed five children. A cluster munition killed a child in southern Syria, and Syrian authorities arrested a church guard and other suspects in a theft at Our Lady of Peace Church in Homs. Lebanon’s army seized 264 kilograms of explosives near the border and Syrian officials intercepted weapons smuggling attempts, reflecting ongoing cross-border illicit activity. Egypt reiterated support for Syria’s unity and sovereignty. 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxOUlBfSklva2tFMFoxQWtjMzRQejkycV81UU4xR25xM1RwdWlBRHhtRW4xZHVQb0dyNXQ3Z0tmMjhoQThWdVBRcTRTUTBLSmtGQVZCS1hPbmdJN3BUWjdxelBrcVhSOG5GOFl2NzVUbjFTWlgzUUdWQ0F2RkR3bkUta1praktFNTFySGd4WnhNcUJNUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;KELO-AM&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;A News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNUm1SMFZkSWJGSndJRFpwd1ppWVZXUWxuM2NDbG9USGhiSzFCYW9ZT2ZtMDJZajlzRnEzWHVySmt6RE5FVzVDMkZnQkRFcGdlT0RzR3huZlFYWi1leDBVVzMxRFhfUjFGMTVNYll2NVo2ZW1WcUZpeUlzSy00YWYyU29CQlR5ZHdRR19haUQ0WVRBX0dxSXprRnZFWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;شفق نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQZTFQMlhPSkJaZzJ6d05MWXdBTnlaWnAyUy1IWHFJQkdRTmVDU3Y4TjhINVBaQVZhV2MwUXZZUUxmUnMzcTZJSU51dlo0TGE0VjMyX3F4ZWx4LUFFb3o0cEZHMHFXZy1oczRvWEYtclNhUnplbUMxczE1TUJ4eGgyV3dKemREeTNyT0Fz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE43NDhQUFBSQ2lmOXM5a1lQemphVENmRnUxTURBc1k5OGpoY0F2X2Z1UUFYNFM3em80aWVjRWVDa1kzWFRfeEZIeWNxRFVxM3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;MTV Lebanon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a 